* NPN Transistor Circuit

V1 4 0 DC 3
R1 2 5 100k
RC 4 6 RC

* NPN Transistor
* Collector connected to net 4
* Base connected to net 2
* Emitter connected to net 6
Q1 4 2 6 NPN

* Nodes Annotation
* 2 - Base of Q1, connected to one terminal of R1
* 4 - Collector of Q1, connected to +3V and one terminal of RC
* 6 - Emitter of Q1, connected to other terminal of RC
* 5 - Ground